  "headline": "FDA's records show the registered plant on our aztreonam label received a VAI classification on 2026-08-12, 70 days before today",
  "headline_cites": ["E10", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The aztreonam product we use is labeled by A-S Medication Solutions and manufactured at FEI 1450743, which FDA lists as a registered plant.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended on 2026-08-12 and was classified VAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That inspection occurred 70 days before today (2026-10-21).",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant also received a Warning Letter on 2017-06-05 and VAI inspections in 2009, 2012, 2013, and 2018.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our three sites have 20, 17, and 10 days of supply on hand respectively.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from E.R. Squibb & Sons, L.L.C., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
